Evidence 4 of 4 - the relevant lines of checkout v3.2.0. The release renamed the variable; the Deployment still sets DB_URL from the database secret, as it did for v3.1.4:

VERSION = "3.2.0"
DATABASE_URL = os.environ.get("DATABASE_URL", "")    # v3.1.4 read os.environ["DB_URL"]
pool = ConnectionPool(DATABASE_URL, open=False)       # opens connections on the first query

@app.get("/health")
def health():
    return {"status": "ok", "version": VERSION}

Statement: "If health() also ran SELECT 1 through the pool and returned 503 when that failed, the v3.2.0 canary pods would never have become ready."
